===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|сеѵклъ}}, via {{der|ru|gkm|-}} from {{der|ru|grc|σεῦκλον}}, as is {{cog|bg|цвекло́}}, {{cog|mk|цвекло}}, {{cog|sh|ци̏кла}} / {{m|sh|cȉkla}}, {{cog|sk|-}} / {{cog|cs|cvikla}}, {{cog|pl|ćwikła}}, also {{cog|hu|cékla}} and {{cog|ro|sfeclă}}. Hither belongs also the taxonomic {{taxlink|Beta vulgaris var. cicla|variety}} <!-- is the taxonomic variety name literally borrowed from Serbo-Croatian? --> and {{cog|ar|سِلْق}}.

